        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 3023-3, 3 Inch Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n3\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. <b>Half Surface type</b> - door flange is surface applied to face of door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For doors 3/4\" to 1\" thick. Packaged with all wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTo find the proper size Bommer Double Acting Spring Hinge for your doors weight and width. use the charts here: <a href=\"/pages/bommer-double-acting-spring-hinge-selection\"><b>Bommer Spring Hinge Charts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer 3023-3 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Template</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Mounting Type: <b>Half Surface</b></li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 3/4\" to 1\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3023-3.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 3023-3 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 3023 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 3023-3 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>3023-3</td>\r\n<td>35 lbs</td>\r\n<td>2'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>39 lbs<